title: Campaigning
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
card-image: img/flags.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs

= Campaigning

Whether or not we are in an electoral campaign, the party is always trying to broaden its voter base. Who should we focus our campaign efforts on?

- @workers: Robotnicy.
- @new_middle: Inteligencja.
- @old_middle: Drobnomieszczaństwo.
- @rural: Chłopi.
- @bourgeois_landowners: Burżuazja i Ziemiaństwo.
- @unemployed: Bezrobotni.
- @national_minorities: Mniejszości Narodowe.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@workers
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: workers_pps += 6*(1-dissent); workers_pps -= 2 if unemployed >= 15; workers_pps -= 2 if unemployed >= 25; workers_pps += 6*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted = 1; resources -= 1; workers_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress >= 1;

We have increased our campaigning among Robotnicy. [? if unemployed >= 15: The high levels of unemployment make our campaign more difficult. ?][? if wtb_adopted = 1 : Adopting the WTB plan gives us a new rallying point around which to attract workers. ?]

@new_middle
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: new_middle_pps += 6*(1-dissent); new_middle_pps -= 4 if socialism <= 49 and peoples_party == 0; resources -= 1; peoples_party_support += 1;

We have increased our campaigning among Inteligencja. [? if socialism <= 49 and peoples_party == 0: The popular antipathy towards socialism among this group makes our campaign more difficult. ?] [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among the middle class than before. ?]

@old_middle
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: old_middle_pps += 5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; old_middle_pps -= 3 if nationalism >= 51 and peoples_party == 0; peoples_party_support += 1

We have increased our campaigning among Drobnomieszczaństwo. [? if nationalism >= 51 and peoples_party == 0: The high levels of nationalism among this group makes our campaign more difficult. ?] [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among the middle class than before. ?]

@rural
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: rural_pps += 5*(1-dissent); rural_pps -= 3*(1-dissent) if peoples_party == 0; resources -= 1; peoples_party_support += 1; rural_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if rural_policy >= 2

We have increased our campaigning among Chłopi. [? if peoples_party == 0: We have not historically campaigned much among the farmers, and they do not trust us. ?][? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among farmers than before. ?][? if rural_policy >= 2 : Our rural policies have made it easier for us to build support among farmers. ?]

@bourgeois_landowners
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: bourgeois_landowners_pps += 3*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; bourgeois_landowners_pps -= 2 if socialism >= 60

We have increased PPS campaigning among Burżuazja i Ziemiaństwo. The inherited campaign system gives this small and generally skeptical constituency a lower base gain than the other groups. [? if socialism >= 60: Strong public support for socialism makes this outreach more difficult. ?]

@unemployed
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: unemployed_pps += 6*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; unemployed_pps -= 3 if welfare < 0; unemployed_pps += 6*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted = 1; unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare >= 2;

We have increased our campaigning among Bezrobotni. [? if welfare < 0: The welfare cuts and resultant poverty make our campaign more difficult, since we are associated with the government that enacted these cuts, and our campaign may even backfire. ?][? if wtb_adopted = 1 : Adopting the WTB plan gives us a new rallying point around which to attract support from the unemployed. ?]

@national_minorities
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: peoples_party == 1
on-arrival: national_minorities_pps += 6*(1-dissent); resources -= 1

We have increased our campaigning among Mniejszości Narodowe.
